WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.162 --> 00:00:05.218
- Look me in my eyes and listen.

00:00:05.218 --> 00:00:08.421
Birthdays are tricky affairs.

00:00:08.421 --> 00:00:13.408
(suspenseful music)

00:00:19.682 --> 00:00:22.926
Everyone wants their time
to feel celebrated, special.

00:00:22.926 --> 00:00:24.425
I work at an internet content company

00:00:24.425 --> 00:00:26.489
with 23 other coworkers.

00:00:26.489 --> 00:00:29.960
That means 24 birthdays,
where at precisely 4pm,

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:33.187
a box from Bellywise Bakers is
delivered to the front door.

00:00:33.187 --> 00:00:37.343
A box of birthday cookies,
23 chocolate chip, one blue.

00:00:37.343 --> 00:00:39.015
That blue cookie is a blue velvet

00:00:39.015 --> 00:00:41.929
orgastic chip cookie,
Bellywise's specialty.

00:00:41.929 --> 00:00:44.657
You can't buy one, you only
get one on your birthday.

00:00:44.657 --> 00:00:46.190
But every birthday, I'm telling you,

00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:47.768
the receptionist grabs it.

00:00:47.768 --> 00:00:50.473
No matter whose birthday it
is, no matter what people say,

00:00:50.473 --> 00:00:53.457
he eats the blue velvet
orgastic chip cookie.

00:00:53.457 --> 00:00:55.477
Until September 16th.

00:00:55.477 --> 00:00:58.744
September 16th is my birthday,
and I wanna feel celebrated.

00:01:03.103 --> 00:01:05.203
- Happy birthday, Henry.

00:01:05.203 --> 00:01:07.874
Sorry Tony took the blue
velvet orgastic chip cookie.

00:01:07.874 --> 00:01:10.241
- I know, they're so good.

00:01:10.241 --> 00:01:11.914
- But Tony always takes it.

00:01:11.914 --> 00:01:13.214
- It's not right.

00:01:13.214 --> 00:01:15.059
- Next week's my birthday, and damn it,

00:01:15.059 --> 00:01:17.756
I want that blue velvet
orgastic chip cookie.

00:01:17.756 --> 00:01:20.589
I have a plan, but I
need your help to do it.

00:01:20.589 --> 00:01:21.597
Your cut will be half of the

00:01:21.597 --> 00:01:23.347
blue velvet orgastic chip cookie.

00:01:23.347 --> 00:01:25.057
You in?

00:01:25.057 --> 00:01:26.496
- Why me?

00:01:26.496 --> 00:01:28.354
- I trust you to do the right thing.

00:01:28.354 --> 00:01:30.116
Let's go.

00:01:30.116 --> 00:01:32.043
- [Henry] All right, where are we going?

00:01:34.092 --> 00:01:39.075
(suspenseful music)

00:01:42.606 --> 00:01:43.851
- Hey, Tony.

00:01:43.851 --> 00:01:45.905
Did I get any birthday packages today?

00:01:45.905 --> 00:01:47.279
- I don't know, let me check.

00:01:52.142 --> 00:01:53.261
Happy birthday.

00:01:53.261 --> 00:01:55.232
- Thanks, can I borrow some scissors?

00:02:01.672 --> 00:02:02.716
Thanks.

00:02:08.901 --> 00:02:10.782
- [Henry] Hey, Colby, whatcha got there?

00:02:10.782 --> 00:02:13.606
- A birthday package from my mom.

00:02:13.606 --> 00:02:16.386
(phone rings)

00:02:16.386 --> 00:02:17.885
- Hey, Tony.

00:02:17.885 --> 00:02:19.330
Why don't you let me take care of these?

00:02:19.330 --> 00:02:21.106
- Yeah, it sounds like
there's a phone call.

00:02:21.106 --> 00:02:23.526
- Phone can wait, it's
birthday cookie time.

00:02:23.526 --> 00:02:24.668
(Henry wheezes)

00:02:24.668 --> 00:02:27.373
- Tony, I really think you
should answer the phone.

00:02:27.373 --> 00:02:29.288
- What are you doing? Let go!

00:02:29.288 --> 00:02:30.906
- I'm taking these to the break room.

00:02:30.906 --> 00:02:32.055
It's Colby's birthday.

00:02:32.055 --> 00:02:33.797
- This is my job!

00:02:33.797 --> 00:02:35.370
- [Henry] No, this is not your job,

00:02:35.370 --> 00:02:36.768
your job is to get fucked!
(phone rings)

00:02:36.768 --> 00:02:38.695
- [Tony] I distribute cookies.

00:02:38.695 --> 00:02:40.030
- [Henry] Just go answer the phone,

00:02:40.030 --> 00:02:41.354
just go answer the phone!

00:02:41.354 --> 00:02:42.875
Do your job!
- [Tony] I can't!

00:02:42.875 --> 00:02:45.034
- [Tony] This is my job,
I distribute cookies!

00:02:45.034 --> 00:02:47.862
- [Henry] That's not your--
- [Tony] It is!

00:02:47.862 --> 00:02:49.174
(box falls heavily)

00:03:01.474 --> 00:03:03.612
- No no no, wait, listen, listen!

00:03:03.612 --> 00:03:05.632
This was all Colby's idea, okay?

00:03:05.632 --> 00:03:09.161
He wanted me to steal the blue
velvet orgastic chip cookie

00:03:09.161 --> 00:03:11.564
so that he and I could split it.

00:03:11.564 --> 00:03:13.444
- The birthday bastard!

00:03:13.444 --> 00:03:16.049
- Yeah yeah, but look,
let's, let's stop fighting...

00:03:17.193 --> 00:03:18.838
and you and I can split the cookie.

00:03:18.838 --> 00:03:21.009
- Forget it, that cookie is mine.

00:03:21.009 --> 00:03:23.818
- Look, look, look, if, look, look, look,

00:03:23.818 --> 00:03:27.534
if I don't get half of this blue velvet

00:03:27.534 --> 00:03:32.375
orgastic chip cookie, I
will ruin this entire box!

00:03:32.375 --> 00:03:35.322
- Okay, fine, we'll split it.

00:03:35.322 --> 00:03:38.154
Just don't ruin that blue
velvet orgastic chip cookie.

00:03:41.502 --> 00:03:45.635
- One, two,
- [both together] Three.

00:03:45.635 --> 00:03:47.063
- [Henry] Huh?

00:03:47.063 --> 00:03:48.724
What?

00:03:48.724 --> 00:03:50.425
- [Tony] Oh, no.

00:03:52.289 --> 00:03:53.918
- Did I get any birthday packages today?

00:03:56.967 --> 00:03:57.961
- Happy birthday.

00:03:57.961 --> 00:04:00.103
- Thanks, can I borrow some scissors?

00:04:02.581 --> 00:04:04.678
- Why don't you let me take care of these?

00:04:04.678 --> 00:04:06.807
- Yeah, it sounds like
there's a phone call.

00:04:06.807 --> 00:04:09.749
- Phone can wait, it's
birthday cookie time!

00:04:09.749 --> 00:04:12.689
(angry spluttering)

00:04:16.154 --> 00:04:18.485
- [Henry] Stop spinning.

00:04:18.485 --> 00:04:21.154
- Colby.

00:04:21.154 --> 00:04:23.174
- Look into my eyes and listen.

00:04:23.174 --> 00:04:25.695
Birthdays are tricky affairs.

00:04:25.695 --> 00:04:30.210
(suspenseful music)

00:04:31.620 --> 00:04:36.620
(triumphant music)

00:04:38.819 --> 00:04:40.308
(modem noise)

